<section class="lsec rv dark" id="saas" aria-labelledby="h-saas"><!-- DYNAMIC: $landing->sections[3] (quote) -->
 <div class="lw"><p class="eyb"><span>04 · Custom vs SaaS</span></p><h2 id="h-saas">Custom CRM vs. Off-the-Shelf (Salesforce, HubSpot, Zoho)</h2><div class="qt"><p class="lead">SaaS CRMs charge per user and force your workflow into their template. At 50+ seats, annual licensing fees often exceed the cost of a one-time custom build, and even then you don’t own the code or control every field and rule the way a custom system gives you.</p><ul><li><span>✓</span>Full source ownership</li><li><span>✓</span>Zero per-seat penalties</li><li><span>✓</span>Pay for development once, plus hosting</li><li><span>✓</span>Scale users without a growing licensing bill</li></ul></div>
